----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Key Notes:
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1.Please make sure that the drawing strictly follow the ADM Building Data Delivery Specifications
2.Please make sure you have reviewed the DWG templates supplied with the specifications
3.Please make sure you have reviewed all the attached documents supplied with the specifications
4.Please do not add any layer or attribute which is not listed in the specifications document
5.Please ensure attribute blocks are well inside corresponding polygons area
6.Please ensure the drawing files does not include complex geometries like hatch, arcs, splines, circles etc
7.Please ensure all mandatory attributes are filled-in correctly
8.Please make sure that the UnitNumber, SpaceNumber, BuildingNumber and BuildingOthNumber are progressive numbers starting from number 1, 2, 3 and so on.
9.Please make sure that the valid date format is DD-MON-YYYY ex: 01-jan-2011

